 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. Thank you for seeing me on short notice. My blood pressure is still up, even on my usual treatment, and my carer here thought I should come."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm Lina, I look after Mr Hartley mornings. I take his pressure every day with the home machine, and it's been 160 over 95, most days this week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Lina, that's very helpful. Mr Hartley, have you noticed any symptoms from it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Headaches, mostly in the mornings, at the back of my head."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How about when you stand up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit dizzy, yes. I hold the bench for a second."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blurred vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my eyes are fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling of the ankles?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your history, apart from the blood pressure?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just the blood pressure, for fifteen years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check it now. Blood pressure 158 over 94, and pulse 76.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's the same as at home. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is. Which is why I believe the home machine. Let me listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go ahead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, with no murmurs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I'm seeing is blood pressure above target, which is consistent with your home readings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What does that mean? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It means the treatment isn't doing enough. Before I change anything, I'd like to arrange a blood test for your kidney function and salts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "When can he do that? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Today, if he's willing. I'd like to check it's safe to adjust things. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lina, can you keep recording the morning readings, and bring the diary back? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And try to cut the salt in his meals."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the diary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thank you very much. ~"
  }
